[ <http://swrl.stanford.edu/ontologies/3.3/swrla.owl#isRuleEnabled> "true"^^xsd:boolean ;
   rdfs:comment "DE: Der Abstand des Referenzpunkts der linken Kappe von der Brückenachse berechnet sich aus CAP01XXq00=CAP01XXb04+PAV00XXb02+PAV00XXq00, wobei PAV der angrenzende Fahrbahnbelag ist.; EN: The distance between the reference point of the left cap and the bridge axis is calculated as follows CAP01XXq00=CAP01XXb04+PAV00XXb02+PAV00XXq00, where PAV represents the adjacent pavement." ;
